cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "2026_Soilscape_Genomics: code for the comparison of measured and modelled topsoil properties (Fig. 2 C)"
abstract: >-
  R code comparing measured topsoil pH, soil organic carbon and soil temperature
  (WoSIS profile database, SoilTemp sensor network) with the corresponding
  predictions of global soil maps (SoilGrids 2.0, global soil temperature maps).
type: software
authors:
